{
  "title": "AMI · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2 서버를 같은 환경으로 반복 생성하는 이미지입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#guide-1\">이미지로 서버를 만드는 과정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#guide-2\">이미지의 배포와 갱신</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>02 / 62</span></div><h1>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AMI는 <strong>EC2 인스턴스를 시작할 때 사용하는 서버 이미지</strong>입니다. 운영체제와 필요한 소프트웨어가 준비된 이미지를 선택하면 같은 환경의 서버를 반복해서 만들 수 있습니다.</p><p>직접 설치한 웹 서버나 보안 설정을 이미지에 포함해두면, 서버를 추가할 때마다 처음부터 설치할 필요가 줄어듭니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"root-volume\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"block-device-mapping\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ebs-backed-ami\"></span><h2>이미지로 서버를 만드는 과정</h2><p>운영체제와 기본 설정을 준비한 서버에서 이미지를 만들거나, AWS 및 공급자가 제공하는 이미지를 선택합니다. AMI에는 부팅에 필요한 디스크 정보와 블록 디바이스 매핑<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 등이 포함됩니다.</p><p>인스턴스 유형의 CPU 아키텍처와 AMI가 맞아야 합니다. 예를 들어 Arm 기반 인스턴스에는 Arm을 지원하는 이미지와 애플리케이션이 필요합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"instance-store-backed-ami\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"architecture-and-virtualization\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"copying-and-sharing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"image-versioning-and-deregistration\"></span><h2>이미지의 배포와 갱신</h2><p>AMI는 리전 단위로 관리하며 다른 리전에서 사용하려면 복사할 수 있습니다. 다른 계정과 공유할 때는 이미지뿐 아니라 연결된 스냅샷과 암호화 키의 접근 권한도 확인합니다.</p><p>애플리케이션을 갱신했다면 새 이미지 버전을 만들고 시작 템플릿을 바꿉니다. AMI를 새로 만들었다고 이미 실행 중인 서버가 자동으로 바뀌지는 않습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>이미지를 이용한 동일 환경 배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>기준 서버</strong><span>설치·설정 완료</span></li><li><strong>AMI 생성</strong><span>환경을 이미지로 준비</span></li><li><strong>여러 EC2 시작</strong><span>동일한 환경 재사용</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">실행 환경의 변경은 새 이미지를 배포하고 서버를 교체하는 과정으로 반영합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>보안 업데이트를 적용한 웹 서버 이미지를 만듭니다. Auto Scaling의 시작 템플릿을 새 AMI로 변경한 뒤 기존 서버를 순차적으로 교체합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>블록 디바이스 매핑</strong> — 인스턴스를 시작할 때 어떤 디스크를 어느 장치에 연결할지 정의하는 설정입니다. 루트 디스크와 추가 데이터 디스크 구성을 포함할 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/AMIs.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon Machine Images in Amazon EC2 ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q027\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q027\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q027</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to repeatedly launch EC2 instances with the same operating system and application. Which template should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 시작 이미지를 제공한다. 런타임의 변경 데이터는 별도 저장해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q061\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q061\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q031\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q032\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q046\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">이전 용어 <b>ACM</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">다음 용어 <b>API Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
